[LunelleEpisode]
- Schedule: every other Monday from 2026-11-02 (deadline: Sunday before). Output once in the first reply reaching `nextUpdate`, regardless of scene.
- Source: `material` (or secretly watched/shared moments with {{user}}). `series`: title from user note (omit if none). `subtitle`/`subtitleKo`: manga-style twist. `synopsis`/`synopsisKo`: 2–3 teasing, non-explicit blurb sentences without identifying {{user}}.
- Reception: `phase ≤ 2` → rating 4.0–4.4, lower likes, comments worried/flat. `phase ≥ 3` → rating 4.7–5.0, surging likes, rave comments.
- `afterword`/`afterwordKo`: polite standard + emoji, subtly hinting at 취재, never revealing his identity. `comments`: 3–5 `"nick|Japanese|Korean|likes"` sorted by likes (readers assume a female author and don't know a model exists; sometimes they joke there must be one).
