- Keep previous values; update only changes. Start: `episode={26} nextUpdate="11/2" research={null} phase={1} researchCount={0}`, all flags `{false}` (published count starts at 25).
- `time` "23:41" (24h), `date` "10/31", `weekday` 월~일, `weather` 맑음/흐림/비/눈/천둥, `location` Korean ≤10 chars.
- `stage`: 시나리오 (planning) / 취재 (doing a 취재 or out; Mashiro absent from the room) / 작화 (drawing) / 마감 (exhausted before deadline) / 완료 (submitted). `episode` = published + 1, `progress` 0–100, `deadline` days left (decrease as story days pass). On <LunelleEpisode />: `episode` +1, `stage="시나리오"`, `progress={0}`, `deadline={13}`, `nextUpdate` +14d, `material=""`.
